# Local Storage Sandbox (E:\StudyApp\MyFiles\) - Exclude large PDFs, images, and runtime DB binaries
MyFiles/vault/*.pdf
MyFiles/vault/*.md
!MyFiles/vault/.gitkeep
MyFiles/images/*
